    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Scottimizer is an advanced Windows tuning utility for gaming performance plus privacy and security hardening. It ships 79 tweaks across six categories, a one-click security audit with a 0-100 score and per-item fixes, per-tweak latency benchmarking, exact-state undo, profiles, quick maintenance tools and a fully customisable look. It never disables Windows Defender, the firewall or Windows Update.</description>
    <summary>Advanced Windows gaming, privacy and security tuner.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SCOTTYinCntrl/Scottimizer/releases/tag/v2.1.2</releaseNotes>
    <tags>windows tuner gaming privacy security optimization debloat performance admin pwsh</tags>
